msgid "``sudo apt-get update``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get update``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:15 fd9bfeeaf8e24d7e94a804c64a99e632
msgid "``sudo apt-get install git``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get install git``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:16 9e23c77a4bc743e99f0b08dfd9196e5d
msgid "``sudo apt-get install gitk git-gui``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get install gitk git-gui``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:22 2285430a38634e658c03353f34a3ffd6
msgid "Windows and other Systems"
msgstr "Windows 及其他系统"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:24 15b270beabe7499aae4d4af3f8e3a3c2
msgid ""
"download and install from `git-scm.com's download page <http://git-"
"scm.com/downloads>`__"
msgstr "从 `git-scm.com 下载页面 <http://git-scm.com/downloads>`__ 下载并安装"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:27 104c54cdb6714ec4a29f302b00312f15
msgid "Recommended GUI Tools"
msgstr "推荐的 GUI 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:29 d55b91f0285642e8aac302ef15b0762c
msgid ""
"The git command line, gitk and git-gui tools are the basics that all users "
"should have installed and are available from a few places."
msgstr "git 命令行、gitk 和 git-gui 是所有用户都应安装的基础工具，可从多个渠道获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:31 3cae145bc6c64b1cb34c8793ee6c3b76
msgid ""
"A comprehensive list of GUI tools are listed `here on git-scm.com "
"<https://git-scm.com/downloads/guis>`__ but here are a few of the developer "
"favourites:"
msgstr ""
"GUI 工具的完整列表可在 `git-scm.com <https://git-scm.com/downloads/guis>`__ "
"上找到，以下是开发者最喜爱的几款："

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:33 b6a32ececc8342fe83bd33173283b121
msgid ""
"`GitHub Desktop <https://desktop.github.com/>`__ for Windows and Mac is an "
"easy to use tool with good GitHub integration but has fewer features than "
"other clients."
msgstr ""
"适用于 Windows 和 Mac 的 `GitHub Desktop <https://desktop.github.com/>`__ "
"是一款易于使用且与 GitHub 集成良好的工具，但功能比其他客户端少。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:34 1d8747b89dcb4d59b26e2b14d8c48ff8
msgid ""
"`Sourcetree for Windows and Mac OSX <https://www.sourcetreeapp.com/>`__ is a"
" full featured tool with a nice interface with many features including "
"allowing individual lines from a file to be included in a new commit "
"(simpler tools only allow the entire file to be included)"
msgstr ""
"适用于 Windows 和 Mac OSX 的 `Sourcetree <https://www.sourcetreeapp.com/>`__ "
"是一款界面友好、功能丰富的工具，支持将文件中的单独行包含在新提交中（较简单的工具只能包含整个文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:35 a6b7ca3d38f5488982c383ae2407a27c
msgid ""
"`GitKraken <https://www.gitkraken.com/>`__ is a a full featured tool for "
"Windows, Mac and Linux"
msgstr ""
"`GitKraken <https://www.gitkraken.com/>`__ 是适用于 Windows、Mac 和 Linux 的全功能工具。"

