msgstr "使用 STM 工具链为其他发行版配置"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:104
#: c34e40e9548b476d857ff650fd0cd9e5
msgid "Add some directories to your search path (Facultative)"
msgstr "将一些目录添加到搜索路径（可选）"

