#: 0dd7f111ac79473da31b0c91e29e8db9
msgid ""
"ONLY if you didn't run the install-prereqs script from the previous step."
msgstr "仅当你未在上一步运行 install-prereqs 脚本时才需执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:110
#: fff299208dc9477b885dccea00a7fa11
msgid ""
"Add the following lines to the end of your \".bashrc\" in your home "
"directory (notice the . on the start of that filename. Also, this is a "
"hidden file, so if you're using a file manager, make sure to turn on \"show "
"hidden files\")."
msgstr ""
"将以下行添加到你 home 目录中的 「.bashrc」文件末尾（注意文件名以 . "
"开头，这是隐藏文件，如果使用文件管理器，请确保开启「显示隐藏文件」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:120
#: 1f7e367fc8384be9a60e7067279c19b5
msgid "Then reload your PATH by using the \"dot\" command in a terminal"
msgstr "然后在终端中使用「点」命令重新加载 PATH"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:128
#: b297e8b692a548ee8030852790abca4e
msgid ""
"Do not use this if you have already use the ``install-prereqs-ubuntu.sh`` "
"script !"
msgstr "如果已使用 ``install-prereqs-ubuntu.sh`` 脚本，则不要执行此操作！"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:131
#: ac719231f2044d8ca1493b1f43ca40a8
msgid ""
"To build for an autopilot target on Linux you need the following tools and "
"git repositories:"
msgstr "在 Linux 上为自动驾驶仪目标构建，需要以下工具和 git 仓库："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:134
#: 2acd53f1e6454a52b2e9a3ef28a651d3
msgid ""
"The gcc-arm cross-compiler from `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/>`__ (ArduPilot is only "
"built and tested on these specific versions of gcc-arm; if installed with "
"``apt-get`` gcc-arm will not produce a working binary in many cases)"
msgstr ""
"来自`此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/>`__ 的 gcc-arm "
"交叉编译器（ArduPilot 只在这些特定版本的 gcc-arm 上进行构建和测试；通过 ``apt-get`` 安装的 gcc-arm "
"在很多情况下无法生成可用的二进制文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:137
#: 2f30f95562884dbf880d347774285446
msgid "gnu make, gawk and associated standard Linux build tools"
msgstr "gnu make、gawk 及相关标准 Linux 构建工具"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:138
#: c90d729b12f14533837467525b799fb8
msgid "On a 64 bit system you will also need to have installed libc6-i386."
msgstr "在 64 位系统上还需要安装 libc6-i386。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:140
#: 48fadb94c73b490b92c4606a1b7ab90a
msgid ""
"Also, it's worth mentioning here that you want to ensure that the "
"modemmanager package is not installed and the modem-manager process is not "
"running."
msgstr "另外，请确保未安装 modemmanager 包，且 modem-manager 进程未在运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:145
#: fc12de7a742d4867a21471440cd4a0da
msgid "Compiler"
msgstr "编译器"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:147
#: 2070ded1fe2b46e7b2f6b58f4befa3ee
msgid ""
"You need the specific gcc-arm cross-compiler linked above. You need to "
"unpack it where you want, for now let's call this location TARGET_DIR:"
msgstr "你需要上述链接中特定的 gcc-arm 交叉编译器。需要将其解压到你想要的位置，此处暂称该位置为 TARGET_DIR："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:154
#: fe8ff2fd842d40b1a0c4dc6fd80f2cab
msgid ""
"and then add the bin directory from the tarball to your $PATH by editing the"
" $HOME/.bashrc file and adding a line like this to the end. TARGET_DIR is "
"the location chosen previously where you unpacked the toolchain:"
msgstr ""
"然后通过编辑 $HOME/.bashrc 文件，在末尾添加如下行，将压缩包中的 bin 目录添加到 $PATH。TARGET_DIR "
"是你之前解压工具链的位置："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:157
#: 8b66f437e3384de99d6ad21c0747c7c5
msgid ""
"``export PATH=$PATH:TARGET_DIR/gcc-arm-none-eabi-10-2020-q4-major/bin``"
msgstr ""
"``export PATH=$PATH:TARGET_DIR/gcc-arm-none-eabi-10-2020-q4-major/bin``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:161
#: e3c3a147899c4393bb498002db39a104
msgid ""
"Versions of ArduPilot before 4.1 must use the following compiler, gcc-arm-"
"none-eabi-6-2017-q2, which can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/>`__."
msgstr ""
"4.1 版本之前的 ArduPilot 必须使用 gcc-arm-none-eabi-6-2017-q2 编译器，可在`此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:164
#: 6086f00d5a534e1fb4dc6b1b926b7ec5
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "权限"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:166
#: 5f17971ef1ab4502ad01f76d5f4d2ece
msgid "You need to make your user a member of the dialout group:"
msgstr "需要将你的用户加入 dialout 组："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:172
#: d6098c9144b74b20a06a30521f9ea581
msgid ""
"You will need to log out and then log back in for the group change to take "
"effect."
msgstr "需要注销后重新登录，组更改才能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:176
#: 42c6b5584bc446e2abb23a603bbe9e5e
msgid ""
"Now you should be able to build with waf as described in `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"现在你应该可以按照 `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ 中的说明使用 waf "
"进行构建了。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:179
#: a50300bac13d432ca7d2074295dad5aa
msgid "ccache for faster builds"
msgstr "使用 ccache 加快构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:181
#: 402a36b71b0a40f2bc2c7b7fa40828f6
msgid ""
"Installing *ccache* will speed up your builds a lot. Once you install it "
"(for example with \"sudo apt-get install ccache\") you should link the "
"compiler into /usr/lib/ccache like this:"
msgstr ""
"安装 *ccache* 可以大幅加快构建速度。安装完成后（例如通过「sudo apt-get install ccache」），应将编译器链接到 "
"/usr/lib/ccache，如下所示："

